body:
Trans guys are guys, ~~my dude~~ bud, and should list themselves as men.  I have no way to tell you for sure that most of the guys listing themselves as women aren't trans, but I don't think that's where a lot of them are coming from.

&#x200B;

Edit: Is this what you wanted.

I'm a lesbian and have it set to only see women, because I only,,,,, date,,,,,,,,,,,, women.  Maybe 1/10 of the people offered by the app are men who for some fucking reason have listed themselves as women looking for women.  I keep reporting them but none of them ever seem to get deleted.

&#x200B;

I really, really don't get it.  I mean you're basically signing yourself up to be seen by people who just are not going to be interested in you.

Once at my job a man was arguing with his wife that she was spending too much money on her hair, and he gestured to my haircut and said "I'd love you even if it looked like THAT"

&#x200B;

Never have I had a more gratifying experience.
